{"id": "DfHm9AnvLEt", "title": "Video by 10kadumunderground", "description": "Maine poori duniya paint kar di… bas tumhara chehra hi adhura reh gaya 🥀\n\nUski har cheez mein rang bhara, raat ka kamra, galli ki lamp, stage ki roshni… par woh hamesha pencil ki ek lakeer hi rahi. Ek laal dhaaga tha jo maine kabhi nahi chhoda, bas uski taraf se dheela pad gaya.\nAb poori bheed mujhe dekhti hai… aur jise dekhna tha, woh bheed mein bhi bina rang ke khadi thi, aur chali gayi.\nMain aaj bhi uske sapne likhta hoon, deewar pe uski tasveer puri kar di… bas chehra nahi bana paaya.\n\n🎵 Adhure - @checker_aar\nArt by: @artandartists_ai\n\nUsko bhejo jo tumhari kahani ka sabse adhura panna hai 🤍\n\nAdhure | Hindi rap love song | sad rap | one sided love | adhura pyaar | heartbreak rap | gouache painting | unfinished painting | animated music video | lyrics reel\n\n#Adhure #HindiRap #SadRap #AdhuraPyaar #gouachepainting", "channel": "10kadumunderground", "uploader_id": "33928685960", "uploader": "10 Ka Dum", "timestamp": 1793364299, "like_count": 30, "comment_count": 8, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/149.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1621375209462880a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 63.89, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr22-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQPU63JVx87ORXKymffWnCon9dJCZ00CijN-mzLPwrsDhyd5UgrQfdFWHlhyEtLHK25MbQskVP0uKb6PyR-uQkHlZS9tuixLFJKHuns.mp4?_nc_cat=107&_nc_oc=AdrydtC3BxS7mLw6ruMAtfDQhfjp014RisElXb75fkk7H6veMyIMameGoIYHvnI1ksk1udxt5S_GuR5IFxaBAc8p&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr22-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=lxC7BwC-LosQ7kNvwEZY50y&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=e2z0AkoQUUP2VeqSi